        <activityName xml:lang="en">Solder, bar, Sn63Pb37, for electronics industry, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Solder, bar, Sn63Pb37, for electronics industry, at plant
Data are based on literature (report from a European research project in the field of lead-free soldering). Infrastructure and transportation efforts are based on own assumptions.;
UUID: 003ebeae-af48-312e-8bdd-b2d0e57715e5
This dataset includes raw material input, energy consumption and emissions (air), as well as an estimation of the efforts for transportation and of the infrastructure for the production of solder bar.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical solder material for the electronics industry. Production through melting process out of respective metals. Data based on literature.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: own estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_003ebeae-af48-312e-8bdd-b2d0e57715e5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
